        "body": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>We design for real, lived days, rooted in India's handwoven tradition. Every KRAMÈ garment is thoughtfully crafted to honour traditional textiles while offering timeless design, refined comfort and effortless versatility. Unlike trend-driven fashion, we build a wardrobe that is timeless, functional and consciously made — quietly confident, thoughtfully crafted, and grounded in every detail.</p>"
